{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a fully serverless REST API using Function Compute behind an API Gateway, with Tair cache and RDS for spiky traffic."}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","dns","cloud-native-api-gateway","waf","fc","tair","rds","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Mobile App","group":"internet","why":"Native mobile clients calling the REST API."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to the gateway."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-dns","from":"app","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"API VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Managed Higress gateway handling auth, throttling and routing."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"gw","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks on the public API."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-gw","from":"app","to":"gw","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"fc","label":"API Functions","group":"vpc","why":"Serverless functions that scale to zero; pay only per request."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gw-api","from":"gw","to":"api","label":"REST"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Absorbs read spikes so functions stay fast and cheap."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Database","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Durable storage with a zone standby for HA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and metrics for functions and gateway."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless REST API with Cloud-native API Gateway, WAF, Function Compute, Tair cache and RDS in Singapore."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw an ACK-based microservices platform with MSE Nacos for discovery, a cloud-native API gateway, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","ack","mse","rocketmq","tair","polardb","sls","arms"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Clients","group":"internet","why":"Callers reaching the 20 Java microservices."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the public domain to the ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Microservices VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer distributing traffic across zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Single API entry point routing to all 20 services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the 20 Java microservices as Kubernetes pods."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ack","from":"gateway","to":"ack"}
{"t":"node","id":"mse","product":"mse","label":"MSE Nacos","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Service discovery and configuration for all microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mse","from":"ack","to":"mse","kind":"control","label":"register"}
{"t":"node","id":"mq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Async messaging decoupling services from each other."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mq","from":"ack","to":"mq","kind":"async","label":"events"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Shared cache for sessions and hot data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"polardb","label":"PolarDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational database for persistent service data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized log collection for all services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"monitor","product":"arms","label":"ARMS APM","group":"sg","why":"Distributed tracing and monitoring across services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-monitor","from":"ack","to":"monitor","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"ACK cluster behind ALB and API Gateway, with MSE Nacos, RocketMQ, Tair, PolarDB, SLS and ARMS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a highly available online store in Singapore across two zones, with ESA for edge acceleration and Auto Scaling for sales peaks."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls","cloudmonitor"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers (30k daily)","group":"internet","why":"Customers browsing and buying from Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the store domain to ESA edge nodes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets and accelerates dynamic API calls across Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Store VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across two availability zones for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF 3.0","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the storefront from OWASP attacks and bot abuse during sales."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"say","text":"Compute runs on ECS in two zones with Auto Scaling to handle big sales peaks automatically."}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Web servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the store application redundantly in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales instances up during sales peaks and down after."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair and orders to RDS, both deployed across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores shopping carts and sessions with sub-millisecond latency."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Primary relational database for orders, products and users."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product images and static assets served by ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding observability with CloudMonitor and SLS for metrics and centralized logging."}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects application logs for troubleshooting and analytics."}
{"t":"node","id":"monitor","product":"cloudmonitor","label":"CloudMonitor","group":"sg","why":"Monitors resource metrics and triggers scaling alarms."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-monitor-app","from":"monitor","to":"app","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Highly available online store in Singapore (ap-southeast-1) with ESA edge acceleration, ALB with WAF, multi-zone ECS with Auto Scaling, Tair cache, RDS database, OSS media storage, and CloudMonitor/SLS observability."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a RAG assistant on ACK using Dify, Model Studio for Qwen, Milvus for vector search, and OSS for documents."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ack","dify-on-ack","model-studio","milvus","oss","rds","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internal users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Staff asking policy and wiki questions."}
