{"t":"req","text":"Budget is about 500 dollars a month at launch."}
{"t":"say","text":"To stay near $500/month, I'll swap RDS for Tablestore (serverless, pay-per-request) and OSS assets to CDN."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"tablestore","label":"Player profiles store","group":"vpc","why":"Serverless NoSQL, no idle cost; fits tight budget better than RDS."}
{"t":"node","id":"cdn","product":"cdn","label":"CDN","group":"edge","why":"Cheaper than ESA for serving static game assets only."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cdn-assets","from":"cdn","to":"assets","label":"static"}
{"t":"remove","id":"e-esa-assets"}
{"t":"say","text":"SAE, Tair, RocketMQ, Tablestore and CDN together should keep you close to your $500 target."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Swapped RDS for serverless Tablestore and added CDN for cheaper static assets to fit the $500/month budget."}

